Reading the table:
 - leaf0_acc_err tracking tmpl_floor_err  => ALIASING (input below floor; uncatchable).
 - leaf0_acc_err >> tmpl_floor_err        => OVERCONFIDENCE (net wrong on separable input).
 - high ens_agree_wrong                   => leaves collapse identically => aliasing, gate can't help.
 - disagree_gate resid_err << leaf0_acc_err => confident-wrong WAS catchable by ensemble.
